ightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","review_id":"hfNfg2pyWARFffEMCakgFQ","date":"2018-04-10T00:57:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9509271383285522,"text_excerpt":"Great! We went to central city bbq on a whim and wee delightfully surprised. I appreciate when a restaurant at the end of the night runs out of food (because that means it's fresh). We unfortunately missed the Mac n cheese and the fries but what we did get was delicious! We were 4 and ordered the 5 meats/ 4 sides. Smoked boudin, ribs, pulled pork and chopped brisket. Coleslaw, cornbread, potato salad and Brussel sprouts. Everything was delicious and we were impressed by the fully stocked bar. The dining room was clean and comfortable. So happy to find bbq close by where we were staying!"},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","review_id":"ephrMuu6dq0iRR9wQrV2rw","date":"2017-09-22T14:47:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9466904997825623,"text_excerpt":"Call me crazy but I personally think CC beats out all of the other BBQ places in the city. I am a BBQ fiend so I've tried the majority of the spots and this place reigns at the top. Not only do I love the building, but I love the food even more. You gotta try the smoked chicken wings on the appetizers. Delicious! The ribs literally fall off the bone, the brisket is great as well as the burnt ends, and the sausage that I've tried has been great as well. They have several options for sauces available so pick to your liking. Sweet, spicy,smoky, you name it. The sides!! Rarely do u find at a BBQ place that the sides are equally as good as the meat. This is definitely the case here. They've go..."},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","review_id":"SKrP1hrLx0M-JzG0X1sPbA","date":"2018-07-08T13:55:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9447336196899414,"text_excerpt":"Probably went at the worst time for a first visit (4th of July lunchtime). However they really did well to accommodate everyone despite running out of choice items like ribs and Chicken as expected in a busy BBQ place that smokes all its meats each day. We tried the \"5 plus 4 Sampler platter\" 5 meats for sides. Says feeds 3 but really was more than 4 of us could eat. Perfect tender and juicy brisket, absolutely perfect tender and juicy pulled pork, and the burnt ends were the best I've ever had. The smoked wings were really a treat with their \"white sauce\". They have 3 different BBQ sauces to dip into (Sweet, spicy and vinegary) and they are great on their own or mixed to create that perf..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","photo_id":"uM2pTMBM9hPH127CVifBbw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/uM2pTMBM9hPH127CVifBbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8844813108444214},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","photo_id":"AJpXGQAoFx_gLwdw-V4OfA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/AJpXGQAoFx_gLwdw-V4OfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.865952730178833},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","photo_id":"eb127rGb9r31hxV3EZXcxQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eb127rGb9r31hxV3EZXcxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466008305549622},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","photo_id":"XXeS8Q7lJXZ_MRLeZH6v-A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XXeS8Q7lJXZ_MRLeZH6v-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8309543132781982},{"business_id":"aLsbsBbaJzYw3chcdQlCIw","photo_id":"YuNKKg3vnvyAd80N7PltKA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YuNKKg3vnvyAd80N7PltKA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7870784997940063}]},"notebook_case":null}
